# Skills and Workflows

| Task | Skill | Workflow file |
| --- | --- | --- |
| New feature / module / endpoint group | `feature` (after Superpowers) | `.cursor/workflows/feature.md` |
| Bug | `bugfix` | `.cursor/workflows/bugfix.md` |
| Behaviour-preserving change | `refactor` | `.cursor/workflows/refactor.md` |
| One endpoint | `api-endpoint` | `.cursor/workflows/api-endpoint.md` |
| Schema change | `db-migration` | `.cursor/workflows/db-migration.md` |
| New module skeleton | `nest-module` | — (`prompts/generate/create-module.md`) |
| Spec / OpenAPI audit | `doc-conformance` | `.cursor/workflows/doc-conformance.md` |
| Pull the AC | `requirements-check` | — |
| Final QA over HTTP | `acceptance-check` | — |

Workflows embed the roles `Researcher → Executor → Skeptic`; the audit is `Researcher → Skeptic`.

